    "description": "一道非常美味的豆腐茄子煲，做法家常且非常下饭。",
    "total_time_minutes": null,
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "84879df1-d954-4342-af50-8c1e5ffefa12",
        "text": "将老豆腐切成5毫米左右的厚片备用。",
        "duration_seconds": null,
        "duration_source": "unknown",
        "attention_type": "hands_on",
        "action_type": "chop",
        "instruction_source": "source",
        "source_start_seconds": 5.12,
        "source_end_seconds": 16.24,
        "source_excerpt": "首先我们准备老豆腐1块（约400克） | 将豆腐直接切成5毫米左右的厚片备用 | 同学们注意，最好将豆腐切厚一些，这样在煎制的时候不容易煎碎保持完整"
      },
      {
        "id": "9c43d253-bbe0-498d-b8c6-7ec62fad1f6e",
        "text": "将紫皮茄子切成滚刀块备用。",
        "duration_seconds": null,
        "duration_source": "unknown",
        "attention_type": "hands_on",
        "action_type": "chop",
        "instruction_source": null,
        "source_start_seconds": null,
        "source_end_seconds": null,
        "source_excerpt": null
      },
      {
        "id": "7bb46474-9365-4bb4-b617-4b4754b5627d",
        "text": "将五花肉切成颗粒状备用。",
        "duration_seconds": null,
        "duration_source": "unknown",
        "attention_type": "hands_on",
        "action_type": "chop",
        "instruction_source": null,
        "source_start_seconds": null,
        "source_end_seconds": null,
        "source_excerpt": null
      },
      {
        "id": "8830f15c-97af-4450-8079-1f2a465cd20b",
        "text": "将大红椒去籽切成颗粒粒，大蒜拍散剁碎，香菇切成颗粒，小葱头切成颗粒备用。",
        "duration_seconds": null,
        "duration_source": "unknown",
        "attention_type": "hands_on",
        "action_type": "chop",
        "instruction_source": "source",
        "source_start_seconds": 31.46,
        "source_end_seconds": 45.8,
        "source_excerpt": "准备大红椒1个去籽之后切成颗粒粒备用 | 准备大蒜几颗拍散之后剁碎备用 | 准备香菇2朵切成颗粒备用 | 准备小葱头2根切成颗粒备用"
      },
      {
        "id": "42360fc6-6278-47e9-acb3-4d6f01f7951d",
        "text": "锅烧热后加入适量的油滑锅，然后将热油倒出。",
        "duration_seconds": null,
        "duration_source": "unknown",
        "attention_type": "hands_on",
        "action_type": "prep",
        "instruction_source": null,
        "source_start_seconds": null,
        "source_end_seconds": null,
        "source_excerpt": null
      },
      {
        "id": "659fcced-df21-4b65-bd8b-152e52098461",
        "text": "热油倒出后加入少许底油和约0.5克食用盐均匀撒在锅中，转微小火，将切好的豆腐依次下入锅中，小火慢煎6分钟至两面金黄，翻面时再撒上适量食用盐。",
        "duration_seconds": 360,
        "duration_source": "stated",
        "attention_type": "hands_on",
        "action_type": "sear",
        "instruction_source": null,
        "source_start_seconds": null,
        "source_end_seconds": null,
        "source_excerpt": null
      },
      {
        "id": "a53d2e60-6ccf-4f15-8e36-810c5c26feb9",
        "text": "将煎好的豆腐放入煲仔中垫底备用。",
        "duration_seconds": null,
        "duration_source": "unknown",
        "attention_type": "hands_on",
        "action_type": "assemble",
        "instruction_source": "source",
        "source_start_seconds": 84.14,
        "source_end_seconds": 88.34,
        "source_excerpt": "豆腐煎好之后放入煲仔中垫底备用"
      },
      {
        "id": "a9018efc-cbbf-4654-89cf-8afae1cd9783",
        "text": "用煎豆腐剩下的油烧热，将肥肉粒下锅爆香炒出猪油。",
        "duration_seconds": null,
        "duration_source": "unknown",
        "attention_type": "hands_on",
        "action_type": "sear",
        "instruction_source": "source",
        "source_start_seconds": 91.82,
        "source_end_seconds": 103.54,
        "source_excerpt": "我们直接用上一步煎豆腐剩下的油烧热 | 然后将切好的肥肉粒下锅爆香炒出猪油 | 同学们切记，猪肉不能一次性爆得太干"
      },
      {
        "id": "a90946f2-e950-40be-a227-3b04eb6dfcd7",
        "text": "爆出猪油后将茄子下锅，转中小火煸炒5分钟至熟。",
        "duration_seconds": 300,
        "duration_source": "stated",
        "attention_type": "hands_on",
        "action_type": "simmer",
        "instruction_source": null,
        "source_start_seconds": null,
        "source_end_seconds": null,
        "source_excerpt": null
      },
      {
        "id": "6b8cb857-454d-4378-a4ea-17098a371ff8",
        "text": "锅中加入约8克蚝油、约5克生抽酱油从锅边淋入、约2克老抽调色，再加入少许清水翻炒均匀。",
        "duration_seconds": null,
        "duration_source": "unknown",
        "attention_type": "hands_on",
        "action_type": "season",
        "instruction_source": "source",
        "source_start_seconds": 126.96,
        "source_end_seconds": 147.2,
        "source_excerpt": "茄子炒香炒熟之后开始调味 | 锅中加入适量的蚝油（约8克） | 加入适量的生抽酱油从锅边淋入（约5克） | 加入适量的老抽调色（约2克） | 再加入少许清水之后将其翻炒均匀"
      },
      {
        "id": "a61b3972-9b34-43ec-9e8f-31f609163fa2",
        "text": "中途加入大红椒粒和香菇粒炒至断生。",
        "duration_seconds": null,
        "duration_source": "unknown",
        "attention_type": "hands_on",
        "action_type": "mix",
        "instruction_source": "source",
        "source_start_seconds": 147.4,
        "source_end_seconds": 153.22,
        "source_excerpt": "中途加入切好的大红椒粒和香菇粒炒至断生"
      },
      {
        "id": "6b5f104a-171a-4159-95ac-e86e32abf99e",
        "text": "加入适量的水淀粉将茄子收汁，加入少许明油出锅放入煲仔中。",
        "duration_seconds": null,
        "duration_source": "unknown",
        "attention_type": "hands_on",
        "action_type": "assemble",
        "instruction_source": "source",
        "source_start_seconds": 153.22,
        "source_end_seconds": 164.74,
        "source_excerpt": "再加入适量的水淀粉将茄子收汁 | 茄子收汁之后加入少许的明油即可出锅放在煲仔中"
      },
      {
        "id": "12b921d5-da47-4e6e-9a05-088796efef48",
        "text": "上菜之前再次将其烧开撒上葱花即可。",
        "duration_seconds": null,
        "duration_source": "unknown",
        "attention_type": "hands_on",
        "action_type": "plate",
        "instruction_source": null,
        "source_start_seconds": null,
        "source_end_seconds": null,
        "source_excerpt": null
      }
    ],
